protocol={'utc':now(),'status':'PREREGISTERED_BEFORE_ROUTING_AND_FITS','question':'Does retaining publicly observable object identity in pre-pooling frozen spatial features improve current-state readout?','scope':'Current state only; no dynamics modification or rollout claim','encoders':[str(B/f'cells/roots40/models/joint_seed{s}/final6000.pt')for s in [0,1]],'frozen_encoder_inputs':'Existing DINO cache and original common20 normalization; spatial Transformer frozen, pre-global-mean 256-dimensional token output; both pools use the same frozen observation LayerNorm/Linear to 512D','members':{k:members[v]for k,v in SPLITS.items()},'supervision':'All 40 training roots, 3 episodes x 5 boundaries = 600 records; same targets and schedule both arms. Old common20 linear probes are not a matched comparator.','arms':{'global':'Focal vector is global mean over valid spatial output tokens including robot, projected through frozen observation LN/Linear to 512D, repeated for each requested color; zero focal if that color is unresolved/invisible, same fallback as object arm','object':'Focal vector is mean over valid ROI output tokens publicly registered to the requested color across ONLY the current four frames and two cameras, then the same frozen observation LN/Linear to 512D; zero if unresolved/invisible'},'shared_context':'Same projected 512D global mean, same learned color query, same per-color visible-token fraction for BOTH arms; no extra boxes/geometry/confidence for either head','head':'Shared LayerNorm(1057)-Linear(1057,256)-SiLU-Linear(256,8) object classifier plus identity embedding(3,32); separate shared scene LayerNorm(512)-Linear(512,64)-SiLU-Linear(64,3) drawer classifier','parameters_each':parameters,'route_source':'Existing VisibleRegistry public RGB mean-color tests and anonymous visible masks; raw simulator UID/name only in separate offline routing AUDIT, never to construct features','route_unseen':'No GT fallback, no guessed UID; zero object focal plus availability=0 if no visible registered token; fresh registration per boundary, restricted to the current four frames; no identity information from earlier episode history','routing_gate':'Stop before fitting for any incorrect registered color identity or cache geometry mismatch. Missing/ambiguous routing uses the fixed zero fallback, retains every sample, and is reported. Stop if unresolved among visibly present objects exceeds 5% in train or 10% in any heldout split. GT is used only for audit, never to repair mapping.','updates_each':UPDATES,'batch_size':BATCH,'heads_total':4,'optimizer':{'name':'AdamW','lr':0.0003,'weight_decay':0.0001,'object_grad_clip':1.0,'drawer_grad_clip':1.0},'loss':'Unweighted mean cross entropy of red, blue, pink location and drawer (4 fields); separate object/drawer gradient clipping keeps drawer updates identical between arms','schedule':'Uniform root, then uniform one of 15 stored boundaries; materialized 1500x64 schedule per encoder block, shared arms','initialization_seed':'261019800 + encoder_seed; identical initial head weights within pair','compute':'FP32 heads, no dropout; original BF16 encoder extraction, 4 episodes/batch matching original evaluator. No DINO recomputation.','selection':'Final step 1500 only; no early stopping or hyperparameter search. All four heads frozen before validation/test/C prediction.','evaluation':{'splits':['train','validation','test','externalC'],'cohorts':{'h0':'One branch b0 initial record per independent root','all_boundaries':'15 boundary records per root, including repeated root starts; inferential unit remains root'},'strata':['all','initial_held','initial_not_held'],'primary':['Object location class recalls/confusions and macro recall over supported classes','Holding positive recall, precision, false positive rate, identity errors, multiple-held conflicts, and exact held-object identity','InDrawer positive recall and false positive rate','Drawer class recalls/accuracy'],'secondary':['four_field_exact','nine_relation_exact','mean_four_field_NLL'],'bootstrap':'2000 paired root-cluster resamples per encoder seed, stratified only by requested reporting subset; preserve all sibling records; no pooling the encoder seeds','permutation':'Randomly reorder the three object bundles together with requested identity and visibility; shared-head probabilities must follow the same permutation (max abs tolerance 1e-6). Plumbing/equivariance test, not semantic color-swap robustness.','blindness':'Exploratory reuse: test and C have already been inspected historically; no claim of new blind generalization.'},'interpretation':{'support':'Object arm improves supported-class macro recall and Holding identity/positive recall consistently across two blocks without a material InDrawer regression; paired intervals and denominators shown. Supports usefulness of identity-conditioned selection for these frozen features, not proof global pooling is sole cause.','mixed_or_null':'Report as mixed/null, inspect frozen-feature and supervision limitations; no automatic extra run or conclusion that world-model approach fails.','confounds':'Object arm receives structured public color-to-ROI association restricted to current four frames; content selection and pooling information differ. Equal parameter count/context cannot separate association advantage from bottleneck preservation. Spatial tokens are already contextualized; this is not training a new object encoder.'},'stops':['Any routing gate violation','Nonfinite features/loss','Frozen state or sealed file hash change','GPU lock conflict','Unexpected sample scope','More than 45 minutes compute: stop and report, do not expand budget'],'budget':{'expected_minutes':10,'maximum_compute_minutes':45,'expected_feature_cache_MiB':15,'new_full_RSSM_fits':0,'new_collection':0,'uploads':0}}
save(S/'configs/protocol.json',protocol);save(S/'configs/protected_before.json',old)
